 * Mirrors React's `CheckboxRootState` but exposed as `Accessor<T>` fields so
 * descendants can read each slot lazily — matches the tier-1 compound
 * convention used by `<Progress.Root>` / `<Avatar.Root>`, and honours the
 * no-top-level-reactive-reads rule from Solid 2 RFC 01.
