/**
 * `DialogStore` — thin Solid 2 port of Base UI React's `DialogStore`
 * (`packages/react/src/dialog/store/DialogStore.ts`).
 *
 * Mirrors `PopoverStore` from the popover compound: the actual state
 * machine lives on `<Dialog.Root>`'s local signals (open / mount /
 * transition status / interactions). This store is a thin imperative-API
 * wrapper that exposes:
 *
 * - a `PopupTriggerMap` so `<Dialog.Trigger id="...">` can register
 *   itself and `DialogHandle.open(id)` can resolve the trigger element.
 * - `setOpen(next, details)` — the writer `<Dialog.Root>` binds via
 *   `attachSetOpen` during setup. The handle's `open()` / `close()` /
 *   `openWithPayload()` all route through this.
 * - `setPayload(payload)` — same deal, for the payload slot.
 * - Synchronous `isOpen` read for imperative callers who don't want to
 *   subscribe to reactivity.
 */
