/**
 * Context published by `<OTPField.Root>` to its descendant slot `<Input>`s.
 *
 * Solid 2 adaptation from Base UI React's `OTPFieldRootContext`:
 *
 * - Every reactive entry is exposed as `Accessor<T>` so descendants pull live
 *   values on demand without tripping the top-level reactive-read rule
 *   (RFC 01). The React version ships snapshots; here we ship getters.
 * - Callbacks (`setValue`, `focusInput`, `queueFocusInput`, `handleInputBlur`,
 *   `handleInputFocus`, `reportValueInvalid`, `getInputId`) are plain stable
 *   functions owned by the root — slot inputs capture them into event
 *   closures.
